## Protein-Protein Interaction (PPI) Network Analysis

### 1. Methodology & Database Configuration
To understand the cellular context and functional interactions of the tumor suppressor protein **TP53**, an interactome map was generated using the **STRING database** (Search Tool for the Retrieval of Interacting Genes/Proteins).

*   **Target Protein:** TP53 (Cellular tumor antigen p53)
*   **Organism:** *Homo sapiens* (Human)
*   **Network Settings:** Default interaction sources (Experimental, Databases, Text-mining, Co-expression, Genomic Context) with a medium confidence threshold score (≥ 0.400).

